  "name": "slidewright",
  "description": "Build interactive presentation websites — slide decks projected to a room, controlled by one presenter. Use this skill WHENEVER the user wants to create, build, or design a presentation, slide deck, talk, or \"bài thuyết trình / slide / trình chiếu\", and also when they ask to add/edit slides, restyle a deck, scaffold a new presentation project, reuse their presentation setup in another repo, control slides from a phone (remote, QR code, \"điều khiển slide bằng điện thoại\"), or export slides to PDF — even if they don't say the word \"slide\" but clearly need projected talk visuals (e.g. \"I'm giving a talk next week and need visuals\", \"dựng deck cho buổi chia sẻ\", \"làm mấy trang chiếu cho hội thảo\"). Supports two tracks: a zero-build single HTML file, or a Vite + React project. Do NOT use it for printable documents, normal web apps, or dashboards meant for individual users to interact with.",
